{"name":"Courtyard decking, Camden Town (standard sizes)","source":"Built in Trimble SketchUp through the connector (10 Oct 2026) from the job photos at standard sizes (nothing measured): a walled courtyard 3600 wide and 5000 from the back doors to the far fence. Weed membrane over the ground; a treated timber frame of 47 x 100 joists across the width at about 400 centres between two side joists, set level on packing blocks; deck boards 139 wide and 25 thick with 5 mm gaps running from the doors to the far end, with a border board across each end. The brick walls (cut down to 900 so the deck shows) and the fence are room context; the house, doors and planters are left out. No dimension lines. Read back face by face; units mm, X across the courtyard, Y towards the far fence, Z up.","materials":{"Room: brick":{"color":[170,142,104],"roughness":0.95},"Room: fence":{"color":[150,140,128],"roughness":0.9},"Membrane":{"color":[42,42,44],"roughness":0.9},"Treated timber":{"color":[208,198,150],"roughness":0.85},"Deck board":{"color":[158,98,70],"roughness":0.7}},"moves":{"Boards: Board 1":{"slide":{"offset":[0,-3400,300]},"at":[0.0,1.0],"with":["Boards: Border board, by the doors","Boards: Border board, far end","Boards: Board 2","Boards: Board 3","Boards: Board 4","Boards: Board 5","Boards: Board 6","Boards: Board 7","Boards: Board 8","Boards: Board 9","Boards: Board 10","Boards: Board 11","Boards: Board 12","Boards: Board 13","Boards: Board 14","Boards: Board 15","Boards: Board 16","Boards: Board 17","Boards: Board 18","Boards: Board 19","Boards: Board 20","Boards: Board 21","Boards: Board 22","Boards: Board 23","Boards: Board 24","Boards: Board 25"]}},"view":{"yaw":0.25,"pitch":0.6,"yawMin":-1.1,"yawMax":1.1,"pitchMin":0.2,"pitchMax":1.2},"actions":{"open":"Slide the boards off","close":"Put them back"},"secs":1.8,"apart":["Membrane","Frame","Boards"],"geoms":{"g0":{"v":[-230,-5000,0,-230,0,0,0,0,0,0,-5000,0,-230,-5000,900,0,-5000,900,0,0,900,-230,0,900],"f":[[[0,1,2,3]